### ================================================================
###  SpendWise - Complete REST Client Test File
###  Usage: Open in VS Code with "REST Client" extension installed
###         OR copy each block into your browser REST Client tool
###
###  STEP 1 → Run LOGIN, copy the "token" value from response
###  STEP 2 → Paste token into @token variable below
###  STEP 3 → Run any other request
### ================================================================

# ── Global Variables ─────────────────────────────────────────────
@gateway   = http://localhost:8080
@auth      = http://localhost:8081
@expense   = http://localhost:8082
@category  = http://localhost:8083
@budget    = http://localhost:8084
@report    = http://localhost:8085
@notify    = http://localhost:8086

# Paste your JWT token here after login:
@token = PASTE_YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE


### ================================================================
### ❶  AUTH SERVICE  —  http://localhost:8081
### ================================================================

### [1] LOGIN  ★ Run this FIRST — copy token from response
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@spendwise.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}


### [2] LOGIN as Employee
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "emp1@spendwise.com",
  "password": "Emp@12345"
}


### [3] LOGIN as Manager
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@spendwise.com",
  "password": "Manager@123"
}


### [4] REGISTER new user (Admin only)
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "employeeId": "EMP099",
  "firstName": "Ravi",
  "lastName": "Kumar",
  "email": "ravi.kumar@spendwise.com",
  "password": "Ravi@12345",
  "department": "Finance",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE"
}


### [5] GET my profile (any logged-in user — change userId)
GET {{auth}}/api/auth/profile/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [6] GET all users (Admin / Finance Admin only)
GET {{auth}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [7] UPDATE user (Admin only — change userId)
PUT {{auth}}/api/auth/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "System",
  "lastName": "Administrator",
  "department": "IT",
  "role": "SYSTEM_ADMIN",
  "active": true
}


### [8] GET audit logs (Admin only)
GET {{auth}}/api/auth/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [9] Auth service health check (no token needed)
GET {{auth}}/api/auth/health


### ================================================================
### ❷  CATEGORY SERVICE  —  http://localhost:8083
### ================================================================

### [10] GET all categories (active only)
GET {{category}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [11] GET active categories only
GET {{category}}/api/categories/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [12] GET ALL categories including inactive (Admin only)
GET {{category}}/api/categories/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [13] GET category by ID
GET {{category}}/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [14] CREATE new category (Admin only)
POST {{category}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Travel",
  "description": "Business travel and conveyance expenses",
  "color": "#FF5722",
  "icon": "plane"
}


### [15] CREATE more categories
POST {{category}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Office Supplies",
  "description": "Stationery, printing, office equipment",
  "color": "#2196F3",
  "icon": "briefcase"
}


### [16] UPDATE category (Admin only — change id)
PUT {{category}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Travel & Conveyance",
  "description": "Updated: All travel related expenses",
  "color": "#FF5722",
  "icon": "plane",
  "active": true
}


### [17] DELETE category (Admin only — change id)
DELETE {{category}}/api/categories/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### ❸  EXPENSE SERVICE  —  http://localhost:8082
### ================================================================

### [18] SUBMIT new expense (Employee)
POST {{expense}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Team Lunch",
  "amount": 1200.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "expenseDate": "2026-09-22",
  "description": "Monthly team lunch with Engineering department",
  "merchantName": "Swiggy"
}


### [19] SUBMIT another expense
POST {{expense}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Flight to Mumbai",
  "amount": 8500.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "expenseDate": "2026-09-20",
  "description": "Client visit - IndiGo 6E-201",
  "merchantName": "IndiGo Airlines"
}


### [20] GET all expenses (Admin / Finance Admin)
GET {{expense}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [21] GET my own expenses (Employee)
GET {{expense}}/api/expenses/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [22] GET expense by ID (change id)
GET {{expense}}/api/expenses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [23] GET expenses by department (Admin / Manager)
GET {{expense}}/api/expenses/department/Engineering
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [24] GET pending expenses (Manager / Finance Admin)
GET {{expense}}/api/expenses/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [25] UPDATE expense (Employee — only DRAFT expenses, change id)
PUT {{expense}}/api/expenses/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Team Lunch - Updated",
  "amount": 1350.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "expenseDate": "2026-09-22",
  "description": "Updated amount after bill split",
  "merchantName": "Swiggy"
}


### [26] SUBMIT expense for approval (Employee — change id)
POST {{expense}}/api/expenses/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [27] APPROVE expense (Manager / Finance Admin — change id)
POST {{expense}}/api/expenses/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [28] REJECT expense (Manager / Finance Admin — change id)
POST {{expense}}/api/expenses/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "reason": "Receipt not attached. Please resubmit with proof."
}


### [29] DELETE expense (Employee — only DRAFT, change id)
DELETE {{expense}}/api/expenses/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### ❹  BUDGET SERVICE  —  http://localhost:8084
### ================================================================

### [30] CREATE budget (Finance Admin / Admin)
POST {{budget}}/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "department": "Engineering",
  "amount": 50000.00,
  "period": "MONTHLY",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-30"
}


### [31] CREATE another budget
POST {{budget}}/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "department": "Finance",
  "amount": 30000.00,
  "period": "MONTHLY",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-30"
}


### [32] GET all budgets
GET {{budget}}/api/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [33] GET budget by ID (change id)
GET {{budget}}/api/budgets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [34] GET budgets by department
GET {{budget}}/api/budgets/department/Engineering
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [35] GET budget summary
GET {{budget}}/api/budgets/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [36] GET budget alerts (over-budget warnings)
GET {{budget}}/api/budgets/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [37] GET budget reconciliation
GET {{budget}}/api/budgets/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [38] UPDATE budget (Finance Admin — change id)
PUT {{budget}}/api/budgets/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 60000.00,
  "period": "MONTHLY",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-30"
}


### ================================================================
### ❺  REPORT SERVICE  —  http://localhost:8085
### ================================================================

### [39] GET dashboard summary
GET {{report}}/api/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [40] GET monthly report
GET {{report}}/api/reports/monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [41] GET report by category
GET {{report}}/api/reports/category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [42] GET report by department
GET {{report}}/api/reports/department
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [43] GET budget report
GET {{report}}/api/reports/budget
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [44] GET reconciliation report
GET {{report}}/api/reports/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [45] GET trends report
GET {{report}}/api/reports/trends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [46] GET employee expense report
GET {{report}}/api/reports/employee
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### ❻  NOTIFICATION SERVICE  —  http://localhost:8086
### ================================================================

### [47] GET my notifications
GET {{notify}}/api/notifications/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [48] GET unread notifications only
GET {{notify}}/api/notifications/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [49] GET unread notification count
GET {{notify}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [50] MARK notifications as read
POST {{notify}}/api/notifications/mark-read
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "notificationIds": [1, 2, 3]
}


### ================================================================
### ❼  VIA API GATEWAY  —  http://localhost:8080  (all services)
### ================================================================

### [51] LOGIN via gateway
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@spendwise.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}


### [52] GET categories via gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [53] GET expenses via gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [54] GET budgets via gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [55] GET dashboard report via gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### [56] GET notifications via gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/notifications/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### ❽  HEALTH CHECKS  —  no token needed
### ================================================================

### Eureka Discovery Server
GET http://localhost:8761/actuator/health

### Auth Service
GET {{auth}}/actuator/health

### Category Service
GET {{category}}/actuator/health

### Expense Service
GET {{expense}}/actuator/health

### Budget Service
GET {{budget}}/actuator/health

### Report Service
GET {{report}}/actuator/health

### Notification Service
GET {{notify}}/actuator/health

### API Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health


### ================================================================
### ❾  ACTUATOR INFO  —  see service details (no token needed)
### ================================================================

### Auth info
GET {{auth}}/actuator/info

### Category info
GET {{category}}/actuator/info

### Expense info
GET {{expense}}/actuator/info

### Budget info
GET {{budget}}/actuator/info

### Report info
GET {{report}}/actuator/info

### Notification info
GET {{notify}}/actuator/info

### Gateway info
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/info

### Eureka registered services (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json
